{"id":754,"name":"lurantis","speciesId":754,"dex":754,"form":"normal","generation":7,"types":["grass"],"stats":{"hp":70,"attack":105,"defense":90,"special-attack":80,"special-defense":90,"speed":45},"abilities":[{"name":"leaf-guard","hidden":false},{"name":"contrary","hidden":true}],"height":9,"weight":185,"baseExp":168,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/754.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/754.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/754.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/754.ogg","genus":"Bloom Sickle Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Foice Bloom","flavor":[{"version":"sun","text":"It requires a lot of effort to maintain Lurantis’s vivid coloring, but some collectors enjoy this work and treat it as their hobby."},{"version":"moon","text":"It fires beams from its sickle-shaped petals. These beams are powerful enough to cleave through thick metal plates."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"For self-protection, it pretends to be a bug Pokémon. Both of its arms bear keen-edged petals."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"As it slashes into its enemies, it looks like it’s dancing. Its elegant appearance has led some to call it the most glamorous Grass Pokémon."},{"version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon resembles a beautiful flower. A properly raised Lurantis will have gorgeous, brilliant colors."},{"version":"shield","text":"The petals on this Pokémon’s arms are thin and super sharp, and they can fire laser beams if Lurantis gathers light first."}],"flavorPt":"As pétalas nos braços deste Pokémon são finas e super afiadas, e podem disparar raios laser se Lurantis coletar luz primeiro.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":75,"eggGroups":["plant"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"fomantis","speciesId":753